        "original_id": "600910c2-102a-5aa1-956e-4afaf0f190b6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Colgate University, Eastern College Athletic Conference\n- Teams: Colgate Raiders women's ice hockey, Boston University Terriers women's ice hockey\n- Conferences: ECAC Hockey, NCAA Division I\n- People: Shannon Doyle\n\nFacts:\n- ECAC Hockey used to be affiliated with the Eastern College Athletic Conference, a consortium of over 300 colleges in the eastern United States.\n- The Colgate Raiders women's ice hockey team is an NCAA Division I ice hockey team that represents Colgate University and plays in ECAC Hockey.\n- From 2010 to 2012, Shannon Doyle accumulated 25 points with the Colgate Raiders women's ice hockey team at the NCAA level.\n- Shannon Doyle accumulated 53 points with the Boston University Terriers women's ice hockey program over two seasons from 2012 to 2015.\n- Shannon Doyle missed the 2013–14 season due to injury.",
